hor_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.beta1.official [d33da79d3]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta1 - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6614) - AMD Ryzen 7 5700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nError being spammed at the parsing stage of scripts. Not a breaking bug but pollutes the log console. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\ncreate a new empty scene/project. target for export android. drag Godot icon.svg logo to the scene. attach a gd script to it. Remote deploy. \nWith the new feature in godot 4.4.beta1 where you can see the logcat on the editor, you will see this error being spammed. The more code in your script, the more spam you will see.\n\n```\n ERROR: U_FILE_ACCESS_ERROR\n01-18 16:55:50.784 27792 27836 E godot   :    at: _spoof_check (modules/text_server_adv/text_server_adv.cpp:7144)\n```\n\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8f11c11e-4968-4e00-90f5-7dfacf75164a)\n\n\nIt appears to me, after poking around in the source code, that this error occurs for every parsed symbol in the script parsing stage.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\na new project with a scene, and a default script. Targeting android.\n","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/user